'''Samurai Doggy''' (武者わんこ ''Musha Wanko'', ''Lit. '''Samurai Doggy''''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Doge Dark]]/[[One Horn]] introduced in [[Love is Sickness (Monthly Event)|Love is Sickness]]. They were added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.5 Update|Version 2.2.5]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], they were added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

