==Enemy==
A [[Doge Dark]] riding a [[One Horn]]. It has nearly thrice One Horn's speed, high damage output, killed when knocked back twice and has the ability to knockback all [[Cat Units]]. Its attack rate is even faster than One Horn's (similar attack rate to a [[Bore]]). Both [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] and [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] effects will work on this enemy.

